    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun party board game that supports 5 people to play online! Auction animals, make secret deals, get the ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the course of the game, you and four other players will find new monsters each turn, auction them off, and earn gold. And use the gold to buy new monsters. You can also make a thrilling secret trade with other players at the beginning of each turn, the results of which are only visible to both of you! (Everyone must suffer the consequences of the trade) In the end, the player who gets more monsters wins the game! Fronte's Gate: Monster Auction contains everything you need for a party game, intrigue between players, thrilling games of wisdom, and more fun!</p>",
